tutorial-antag-changeling-goal-welcome = Boas-vindas, metamorfo
tutorial-antag-changeling-goal-kill = Mate um hospedeiro
tutorial-antag-changeling-goal-sting = Ferrão de DNA
tutorial-antag-changeling-goal-devour = Devore
tutorial-antag-changeling-goal-evolve = Armazene e evolua
